  "html": "<p><i>Almost every dungeon has \"Exploring\" quests.  They are a very good way to get rewards for little effort.</i>\n</p>\n<table cellpadding=\"4px\" style=\"border: 1px solid gray; margin: 0px 15%;\">\n<tr>\n<td> <a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Exclamation.png\" title=\"Image:Exclamation.png\"><img alt=\"Image:Exclamation.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/recovered/Exclamation.png\" width=\"96\"/></a>\n</td><td>\n<p><b>This page is possibly outdated and needs updating, please help us getting it up to date again.</b>\n</p><p>Information on this page might be outdated, and thats why we need <b>your</b> help to make this page Up-to-date again!\n</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Exploring Quests\"</h2>\n<p>There are 16 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome_%28Quest%29\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome (Quest)\">Algor's Terror Dome (Quest)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/An_Explorer's_Task_%28Mutanous_Malaise%29\" title=\"An Explorer's Task (Mutanous Malaise)\">An Explorer's Task (Mutanous Malaise)</a></li></ul>\n<h3>C</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Check_Over_Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Check Over Balzack's Burrow\">Check Over Balzack's Burrow</a></li></ul>\n<h3>E</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Explore_The_Embercore_Path_%28TC%29\" title=\"Explore The Embercore Path (TC)\">Explore The Embercore Path (TC)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Exploring_Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Exploring Algor's Terror Dome\">Exploring Algor's Terror Dome</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>E cont.</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Exploring_Algor's_Terror_Dome_%282%29\" title=\"Exploring Algor's Terror Dome (2)\">Exploring Algor's Terror Dome (2)</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Exploring_Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Exploring Frump's Misfortune\">Exploring Frump's Misfortune</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Exploring_Mutanous_M